[2026-07-31T13:32:58+08:00] ai-itinerary-chat-format-fix: Reproduced production itinerary chat stream: backend emitted legacy string place although iOS expected object, causing Decodable format failure. Added tolerant iOS AIChatPlace decoding for both string and normalized object formats; backend AI tests passed. iOS verification is being rerun using the available simulator.
