[2026-07-31T13:53:57+08:00] ai-place-validation-and-streaming-fix: AI chat now sends the trip destination to the server prompt and scopes import-time Apple MapKit place resolution to that destination, preventing ambiguous POIs from resolving in other cities. Added Nginx SSE location with buffering/cache/gzip disabled, no-transform SSE response headers, and client-side delta coalescing. Backend AI tests: 31 passed; iOS iPhone 17 Pro simulator tests: 48 passed. Deploy backend Nginx configuration for public streaming behavior.
[2026-07-31T14:09:27+08:00] ai-place-and-streaming-production-deployed: Deployed travel-companion-api to indo.nuanxinban.com after backing up changed server files. Production Nginx now applies private 20 MiB AI body limits and rate limiting to itinerary chat routes, and disables SSE buffering/cache/gzip. Restarted Gunicorn after deployment. Local health returned 200; public health remains 403; public JSON and SSE chat requests with destination=北京 returned 200. SSE emitted multiple reply events followed by a normalized result card. Backend AI tests: 31 passed; iOS iPhone 17 Pro simulator tests: 48 passed. Existing unrelated Nginx server-name/protocol warnings remain but nginx syntax validation passed.
[2026-07-31T14:26:27+08:00] ai-chat-pre-display-place-validation-fixed: Fixed AI itinerary cards being shown before location validation. The iOS client now validates activity and hotel place hints with destination-scoped Apple MapKit before rendering; successful lookups replace model text with canonical POI coordinates, while unresolvable places are marked unverified and disabled from import. Import-time fallback now omits an unresolvable place instead of saving text without coordinates. Added regression coverage; iOS iPhone 17 Pro simulator tests: 49 passed. No backend release required because production already accepts destination and emits normalized place objects.
[2026-07-31T14:43:39+08:00] ai-poi-semantic-match-fixed: Corrected the earlier POI validation flaw: it previously accepted the first Apple MapKit result even when its POI name was unrelated to the AI place hint. Chat card validation now requires normalized overlap between the queried AI place name and candidate POI name after destination-scoped MapKit search; unrelated candidates are shown as unverified and disabled from import. Added regression tests for the external-destination hotel versus unrelated Beijing hotel scenario. iOS iPhone 17 Pro simulator tests: 51 passed.
[2026-07-31T16:53:43+08:00] apple-maps-server-poi-deployed: Server-side Apple Maps POI verification deployed to production. Backend now exchanges the long-lived Server API auth token for cached 30-min access tokens (/v1/token) and fences AI place hints by trip destination with name+distance checks. APPLE_MAPS_TOKEN written to restricted server env (expires 2026-08-06; regenerate in Apple Developer > Maps > Tokens before then). Verified end-to-end: query 故宫+东城区 resolved to 故宫博物院 39.917839,116.397029; cross-city hotel hint rejected. Production itinerary-chat returns verified POI with coordinates. Server files backed up before upload.
[2026-07-31T17:27:53+08:00] apple-maps-region-fence-fix: Fixed POI verification for foreign destinations. Root causes: zh-CN index misresolved 外南梦 to a Zhejiang reef; searchLocation is only a ranking hint, not a constraint. Now: destination geocoding prefers en-US; every POI search uses searchRegion bounding box with searchRegionPriority=required (Apple rejects combining it with searchLocation), merged with hint-search candidates, all gated by name match plus Haversine fence. AI prompt now requires placeSearch (local-language official name preferred). Production verified: 外南梦 chat returned verified Hotel Santika Banyuwangi, city park, Kawah Ijen with real ID coordinates; cross-country and Chinese-only foreign names still rejected. iOS now decodes server isSelected=false and warns on any activity/hotel card without a verified place. Server files backed up; service active, health 200.
[2026-07-31T18:58:58+08:00] streaming-protocol-v2-deployed: Rewrote itinerary chat streaming. Protocol: model emits NDJSON (think/reply/card/cardx lines); server relays thinking+reply deltas, ships each card IMMEDIATELY with placePending marker, verifies its place against Apple Maps in a background thread, and pushes a cardPlace event with the verified POI (or verified:false). Heartbeat every 10s of silence; worker thread holds app context. Fixed connection-lost: gunicorn timeout 60->300, nginx proxy_read_timeout 60s->300s, client 90->300. Fixed stream format misdetection (token-level prefixes like {" were misclassified as legacy JSON). Card fields now cover description/url/estimated priceMinor/flight details (except actual expense); extras persist through the offline import queue (ConfirmedAIDraftCard.extraData). iOS: thinking-chain block, weak status line, cards render on tag arrival with 地点验证中 spinner and disabled toggle, cardPlace resolves selection. Production verified 3/3 runs: thinking/reply/card/cardx/cardPlace/result sequence correct, out-of-order verification completion handled.
